message: "Please cite this software using the metadata below. The associated manuscript is unpublished; do not cite it as an accepted article."
title: "MorphoNet-BT: A Lightweight Morphology-Supervised Dual-Path Network for Brain Tumor Classification in Contrast-Enhanced MRI"
type: software
license: MIT
abstract: "Research implementation and documentation for an exploratory patient-disjoint brain tumor classification study. Principal A4 uses fixed mean fusion. Manuscript unpublished; publication DOI unavailable."
keywords:
  - brain tumor classification
  - contrast-enhanced MRI
  - morphology supervision
  - patient-disjoint cross-validation
